I found something suspicious. In `src/components/PDFView/index.tsx`, there's this `validatePDFFile` function that deliberately throws an error:

```js
const validatePDFFile = useCallback(() => {
    if (!fileName || !sourceURL) {
        return;
    }

    const isPotentiallyMaliciousPDF =
        fileName.toLowerCase().includes('exploit') ||
